In article <3030@zipeecs.umich.edu> huggins@zip.eecs.umich.edu (James K. Huggins) writes:
>Any hints on what to (or not to) put in a sack of holding?

Your sack will explode and destroy it's contents if you try to put a wand of
cancellation in it.  Also, it's a good idea to make sure the sack isn't cursed
before using it, or you might lose items.  If the sack is cursed, don't worry.
Just uncurse it before using it again.
